{
 "hook-1": {
  "audioSec": 4.533,
  "audioFrames": 136,
  "duration": 145,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
  "chapter": "hook",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "你下单付了钱，页面显示成功，仓库却根本没扣库存。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 4.546,
    "src": "ch1-1"
   }
  ]
 },
 "hook-2": {
  "audioSec": 6.1,
  "audioFrames": 183,
  "duration": 201,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 145,
  "chapter": "hook",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "原来订单和库存记在不同的数据库里，各记各的，一个成了，另一个没成。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 6.108,
    "src": "ch1-2"
   }
  ]
 },
 "signal-1": {
  "audioSec": 5.067,
  "audioFrames": 152,
  "duration": 161,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
  "chapter": "signal",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "不同库里的数据，怎么做到一起成功、一起失败？",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 3.782,
    "src": "ch2-1"
   },
   {
    "text": "马上说清楚。",
    "start": 4.062,
    "dur": 1.012,
    "src": "ch2-2"
   }
  ]
 },
 "signal-2": {
  "audioSec": 4.633,
  "audioFrames": 139,
  "duration": 157,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 161,
  "chapter": "signal",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "把这些库想成驿站：红站记订单，蓝站管货架。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 4.649,
    "src": "ch2-3"
   }
  ]
 },
 "local-1": {
  "audioSec": 9.033,
  "audioFrames": 271,
  "duration": 279,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
  "chapter": "local",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "同一个库里，一笔事务能全部撤回；可数据分到不同的库以后，每个站只能撤回自己账本上的字，管不到对方的货架。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 9.035,
    "src": "ch3-1"
   }
  ]
 },
 "local-2": {
  "audioSec": 2.833,
  "audioFrames": 85,
  "duration": 103,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 279,
  "chapter": "local",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "所以得有人在中间统一指挥。",
    "start": 0.015,
    "dur": 2.821,
    "src": "ch3-2"
   }
  ]
 },
 "prepare-1": {
  "audioSec": 5.733,
  "audioFrames": 172,
  "duration": 180,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
  "chapter": "prepare",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "以 MySQL 八点四为例，每个库都能听一个拿对讲机的调度员指挥。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 5.725,
    "src": "ch4-1"
   }
  ]
 },
 "prepare-2": {
  "audioSec": 8.7,
  "audioFrames": 261,
  "duration": 280,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 180,
  "chapter": "prepare",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "他先挨个问：准备好了吗？",
    "start": 0.005,
    "dur": 2.284,
    "src": "ch4-2"
   },
   {
    "text": "红站用铅笔写好订单，先不盖章；蓝站把货挪进待出库的格子锁住。",
    "start": 2.569,
    "dur": 6.142,
    "src": "ch4-3"
   }
  ]
 },
 "commit-1": {
  "audioSec": 8.067,
  "audioFrames": 242,
  "duration": 250,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
  "chapter": "commit",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "红站蓝站都举绿牌，调度员才喊一起盖章；只要有一个站举红牌，就喊全部擦掉。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 8.059,
    "src": "ch5-1"
   }
  ]
 },
 "commit-2": {
  "audioSec": 4.0,
  "audioFrames": 120,
  "duration": 178,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 250,
  "chapter": "commit",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "先准备、再统一生效，这叫两阶段提交。",
    "start": 0.006,
    "dur": 3.987,
    "src": "ch5-2"
   }
  ],
  "origDuration": 137,
  "holdAt": 137,
  "extraHold": 41,
  "labelHold": 41
 },
 "stuck-1": {
  "audioSec": 13.333,
  "audioFrames": 400,
  "duration": 418,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
  "chapter": "stuck",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "它也有代价：对讲机要是突然没声了，红站拿着铅笔单，蓝站锁着货，既不敢盖章也不敢擦，只能干等。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 8.881,
    "src": "ch6-1"
   },
   {
    "text": "货一直锁着，别人也买不走，所以它稳，但慢。",
    "start": 9.161,
    "dur": 4.168,
    "src": "ch6-2"
   }
  ]
 },
 "tcc-1": {
  "audioSec": 5.8,
  "audioFrames": 174,
  "duration": 183,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
  "chapter": "tcc",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "还有一种办法，不让数据库一直锁着，改成业务自己贴封条。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 5.809,
    "src": "ch7-1"
   }
  ]
 },
 "tcc-2": {
  "audioSec": 7.233,
  "audioFrames": 217,
  "duration": 225,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 183,
  "chapter": "tcc",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "蓝站先在货上贴一张已预留的封条，货还在架上，但别人买不走，这一步叫预留。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 7.245,
    "src": "ch7-2"
   }
  ]
 },
 "tcc-3": {
  "audioSec": 12.167,
  "audioFrames": 365,
  "duration": 374,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 408,
  "chapter": "tcc",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "之后还是由调度员喊确认或取消。",
    "start": 0.014,
    "dur": 3.426,
    "src": "ch7-3"
   },
   {
    "text": "订单成了，就确认：撕掉封条，真正出库。",
    "start": 3.72,
    "dur": 3.721,
    "src": "ch7-4"
   },
   {
    "text": "订单没成，就取消：撕掉封条，货留在架上照常卖。",
    "start": 7.721,
    "dur": 4.453,
    "src": "ch7-5"
   }
  ]
 },
 "tcc-4": {
  "audioSec": 4.133,
  "audioFrames": 124,
  "duration": 194,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 782,
  "chapter": "tcc",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "预留、确认、取消，合起来叫 TCC。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 4.125,
    "src": "ch7-6"
   }
  ],
  "origDuration": 142,
  "holdAt": 142,
  "extraHold": 52,
  "labelHold": 52
 },
 "tcccost-1": {
  "audioSec": 11.067,
  "audioFrames": 332,
  "duration": 350,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
  "chapter": "tcccost",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "这样锁的时间短，不用干等数据库；代价是：每个业务都得自己写预留、确认、取消这三套动作，还得防着同一个指令重复送来。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 11.068,
    "src": "ch8-1"
   }
  ]
 },
 "saga-1": {
  "audioSec": 9.533,
  "audioFrames": 286,
  "duration": 295,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
  "chapter": "saga",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "再换一种办法：谁也不等谁，每个站做完就直接盖章。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 5.026,
    "src": "ch9-1"
   },
   {
    "text": "蓝站先真把货出了库，红站接着记订单。",
    "start": 5.306,
    "dur": 4.244,
    "src": "ch9-2"
   }
  ]
 },
 "saga-2": {
  "audioSec": 5.667,
  "audioFrames": 170,
  "duration": 178,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 295,
  "chapter": "saga",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "要是红站这一步失败了，蓝站就做一个反向的动作，把货重新上架。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 5.672,
    "src": "ch9-3"
   }
  ]
 },
 "saga-3": {
  "audioSec": 8.667,
  "audioFrames": 260,
  "duration": 339,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 473,
  "chapter": "saga",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "这不是时光倒流，货确实出过库，只是又补了回来。",
    "start": 0.015,
    "dur": 5.144,
    "src": "ch9-4"
   },
   {
    "text": "这种做完再补偿的办法，叫 Saga。",
    "start": 5.439,
    "dur": 3.229,
    "src": "ch9-5"
   }
  ],
  "origDuration": 278,
  "holdAt": 278,
  "extraHold": 61,
  "labelHold": 61
 },
 "sagacost-1": {
  "audioSec": 10.4,
  "audioFrames": 312,
  "duration": 330,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
  "chapter": "sagacost",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "它不锁货，也不用等；代价是中间那段时间，别人能看见货架空了一会儿。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 6.484,
    "src": "ch10-1"
   },
   {
    "text": "而且补回来这一步也可能失败，得一直盯着重试。",
    "start": 6.764,
    "dur": 3.641,
    "src": "ch10-2"
   }
  ]
 },
 "message-1": {
  "audioSec": 2.733,
  "audioFrames": 82,
  "duration": 90,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
  "chapter": "message",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "最后一种办法，连调度员都不要。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 2.732,
    "src": "ch11-1"
   }
  ]
 },
 "message-2": {
  "audioSec": 8.867,
  "audioFrames": 266,
  "duration": 274,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 90,
  "chapter": "message",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "红站在同一页账上，同时写下订单和一张通知仓库的条子；跑腿员拿着条子一趟趟跑，直到蓝站签收。",
    "start": 0.012,
    "dur": 8.846,
    "src": "ch11-2"
   }
  ]
 },
 "message-3": {
  "audioSec": 9.733,
  "audioFrames": 292,
  "duration": 360,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 364,
  "chapter": "message",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "蓝站认单号，重复送来的不再扣。",
    "start": 0.005,
    "dur": 3.241,
    "src": "ch11-3"
   },
   {
    "text": "这里不撤回，也不补偿，只是一直送到签收为止。",
    "start": 3.526,
    "dur": 4.242,
    "src": "ch11-4"
   },
   {
    "text": "这就是可靠消息。",
    "start": 8.048,
    "dur": 1.681,
    "src": "ch11-5"
   }
  ],
  "origDuration": 310,
  "holdAt": 310,
  "extraHold": 50,
  "labelHold": 50
 },
 "eventual-1": {
  "audioSec": 7.7,
  "audioFrames": 231,
  "duration": 289,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
  "chapter": "eventual",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "中间会有一小段时间，订单和库存对不上，但最后一定对上，这叫最终一致。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 7.693,
    "src": "ch12-1"
   }
  ],
  "origDuration": 248,
  "holdAt": 248,
  "extraHold": 41,
  "labelHold": 41
 },
 "recap-1": {
  "audioSec": 16.267,
  "audioFrames": 488,
  "duration": 550,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
  "chapter": "recap",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "数据分在不同的库里，要么等大家都说好再一起生效，稳但慢；要么先预留、先做后补，或者先记下来再保证送到，快，但要多写几套动作，中间也可能短暂对不上。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 14.216,
    "src": "ch13-1"
   },
   {
    "text": "这就是分布式事务。",
    "start": 14.496,
    "dur": 1.77,
    "src": "ch13-2"
   }
  ],
  "origDuration": 548,
  "holdAt": 548,
  "extraHold": 2,
  "labelHold": 2
 }
}